From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gleb Radchenko <14540409+GlebRadchenko@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 20:15:14 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 07/11] ggml: GGML_OP_DEPTH_MIX (attention over depth) with CPU
 + Metal kernels; Inkling2 mix() uses it

One dispatch per mix instead of rms_norm, 2 concats, 2 matmuls and a softmax; the Metal kernel is specialized
on (n_q, n_b). 3454 -> 2969 dispatches per decode token, A/B tg64 30.2 -> 33.3 tok/s. KLD vs CPU 0.00128 (ub 512), 0.00121 (ub 1).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
